## API reference

### Slider.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>←</Kbd><Kbd>→</Kbd><Kbd>↑</Kbd><Kbd>↓</Kbd> step by `step`; <Kbd>PgUp</Kbd> / <Kbd>PgDn</Kbd> jump by `largeStep`.
- <Kbd>Home</Kbd> / <Kbd>End</Kbd> jump to min/max.
- Each thumb is tabbable with full `aria-valuenow` contract.
